---
source: crates/gwsim-data/tests/descriptions.rs
expression: "[render(\"ModifyStat(to: Party, stat: Armor, amount: Fixed(24))\"),\nrender(\"ModifyStat(to: Self, stat: HealthRegeneration, amount: Scaled(3, 10))\"),\nrender(\"ModifyStat(to: Self, stat: AttributeRank(DeathMagic), amount: Fixed(2))\"),\nrender(\"SetStat(to: Self, stat: ElementalAttributes, value: Scaled(8, 14))\"),].join(\"\\n\")"
---
All party members gain 24 armor.
You gain 3…10 health regeneration.
You gain 2 Death Magic.
Your elemental attributes are set to 8…14.
